              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karen L"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Worked perfectly! I had leftover mashed new potatoes, I added 1/4 cup Parmesan and 1/4 arrowroot flour. I fried them on med-low for 10 minutes a side, and they were crisp on the outside, tender on the inside. Didn't fall apart at all, but you should be gentle.",
