            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fran"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious!! I did add a little parm cheese and used leftover mashed potatoes. Have made potatoe cakes for years but always had them fall apart. I did as some reviews suggested, lowered heat and put a lid on for 10 minutes per side. Came our picture perfect \nHubby loved it too. \nThanks for the recipe.",
